TEXT -624 232 Left 2 ;Circuit almost matches datasheet schematic, \nbut VREF does not equal 2.5V with negative FB\n \n1. Tuned BJT area so that with negative FB,\nVREF = 2.5V (Christophe Basso uses ratio 3:6:1)\n \n2. Reduced comensator cap values from 20pF to 10pF
